<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>ZeroTheory | Zeroes to Heroes</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #0f2027, #203a43, #2c5364);
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            background: #00c6ff;
            color: #000;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin: 20px 0 10px;
        }
        h2 {
            margin-top: 40px;
            color: #00c6ff;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #e0e0e0;
        }
        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        .card h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .cta {
            margin-top: 50px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .cta a {
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            background: #00c6ff;
            color: #000;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .cta a:hover {
            background: #ffffff;
        }
        footer {
            margin-top: 60px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #cccccc;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <span class="badge">Zeroes to Heroes Challenge</span>

        <h1>ZeroTheory</h1>
        <p>
            ZeroTheory is a learning-first developer community where growth matters more than perfection.
            It focuses on practical skills, consistency, and real-world exposure rather than just theory.
        </p>

        <h2>What is Zeroes to Heroes?</h2>
        <p>
            Zeroes to Heroes is a challenge-based journey designed to help learners move step by step —
            from basics to confidence. Each day introduces hands-on tasks that improve both technical
            and problem-solving skills.
        </p>

        <div class="cards">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Learn by Doing</h3>
                <p>
                    No long lectures. Just tasks, practice, and real implementation.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Real-World Skills</h3>
                <p>
                    Coding, databases, design, communication, and collaboration — all together.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Community Growth</h3>
                <p>
                    Learn alongside others, get feedback, and grow consistently.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Why Join ZeroTheory?</h2>
        <p>
            If you’re tired of just watching tutorials and want to actually build, fail, improve,
            and grow — ZeroTheory gives you the right environment to start.
        </p>

        <div class="cta">
            <a href="#">Start Your Journey</a>
        </div>

        <footer>
            Built for Day 6 – Build & Promote | ZeroTheory
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>

